			"notes": "## [0.0.1-BETA]\n### Added\n- **New flowers and shrubs:** Introduction of unique species such as lavenders, calendulas, foxgloves, hebeas and water lilies.\n- **Berry bushes:** Gathering of sweet and bright berries for food and animal attraction.\n- **Flower Chest:** A special chest that exclusively organises the mod items.\n- **Decorative blocks:** Tall variants, petals and pots for personalisation.\n- **Integration with biomes:** Natural generation of plants in specific biomes.\n- **Public API:** Support for other mods or datapacks to register compatible flowers and blocks.\n- **Custom systems:** Unique rendering, visual effects and drop system.\n- **Multilanguage support:** Available in English and Spanish.\n\n### Changes\n- This is the initial release of the mod."
